window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It was always Sarah. And she was always mine.</p> <p>I woke up in a nightmare. I woke up alone.</p> <p>There was a reason I never let myself have feelings before. Emotions make you stupid. They make you miscalculate.</p> <p>If someone gave me the choice, I’d do it all over again.</p> <p>Only this time, I’d stop everyone who ever looked at the woman I love before they had the chance to hurt her.</p> <p>But since that’s not an option, I’ll just have to stay alive long enough to find her.</p> <p>And together, we’ll break the whole world for what they’ve done.</p>"; 
